","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-09T06:15:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T08:11:29Z","closed_at":"2026-10-19T20:57:33Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7.2.stable (ed1daf0bf)\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS 26.6.2, Apple M4 Pro (arm64), Godot 4.7.2.stable official editor, macOS export with codesign/codesign=1\n\n### Issue description\n\nAn app exported with the built-in signer is killed by the kernel at launch (SIGKILL, exit code 137, no output) as soon as the preset enables three or more entitlements. With one or two entitlements, or with none, the same export launches. The same bundle launches after re-signing only the main executable with Apple's codesign using the same entitlements and the hardened runtime, so the bundle contents are fine and the signature Godot writes is what the kernel rejects.\n\nThe cause is the DER encoding of the entitlements. PList::save_asn1 picks the number of length octets once, from the size of the whole document, and then every node is written with that many octets. Below 128 bytes every length is in short form and the output is valid DER. At 128 bytes or more every length is written in two-byte long form, including lengths under 128 such as the one-byte booleans. That is legal BER but not DER, which requires the shortest form. Apple's userland tools accept it, which is why codesign --verify --strict reports the app as valid, but the kernel on macOS 26 validates the blob as strict DER and treats the signature as invalid. macOS 15 accepts it (CI runners of another project pass with the same exports).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP, or any project with a macOS preset using the built-in signer.\n2. In the preset enable Allow JIT Code Execution, Allow Unsigned Executable Memory and Disable Library Validation (three entitlements).\n3. Export, then run Plain.app/Contents/MacOS/Plain from a terminal: it exits with code 137 and prints nothing.\n4. Disable one of the three and export again: the app runs and prints plain app started.\n5. With the three enabled, re-sign the main executable with Apple's tool and run again: it launches.\n\ncodesign -d --entitlements :- --xml Plain.app/Contents/MacOS/Plain > ent.plist\ncodesign -f -s - --options runtime --entitlements ent.plist Plain.app/Contents/MacOS/Plain\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[der_entitlements_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33236336/der_entitlements_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124317/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issue